$PROBLEM Clonazepam - Yukawa steady-state model
$SUBROUTINES ADVAN2 TRANS2
$INPUT ID TIME EVID AMT RATE II SS CMT DV MDV WT DAILY_DOSE COMED_VPA COMED_CBZ
$DATA data.csv IGNORE=@
$THETA
 (0, 0.144, 144) ; base CL/F
 (0, 0.828, 828) ; weight exponent
 (0, 1.14, 1140) ; valproate factor
 (0, 1.22, 1220) ; carbamazepine factor
$OMEGA
 0.0404
$SIGMA
 0.0346
$PRED
CL=THETA(1)*(WT^THETA(2))*(THETA(3)^COMED_VPA)*(THETA(4)^COMED_CBZ)*exp(ETA(1))
F=1000*DAILY_DOSE/(24*CL)
$ERROR
Y=F+ERR(1)
$TABLE ID TIME DV PRED IPRED CWRES NOPRINT ONEHEADER
